      "description": "A man is bending over and placing a white plate into an open dishwasher while a woman stands behind him, observing. The scene is set in a kitchen with visible countertops, appliances, and windows in the background. The text overlay 'free dishwasher' and 'missing parts' adds a humorous context to the scene.",
